+2. **Reshape:** Reshape the gathered tensor to $(n_{\text{models}}, \text{grid\_size}+1, \text{grid\_size}+1, \text{grid\_size}+1, -1)$ to preserve the 4D grid structure across the batch dimension [S1, unofficial].
 
